  noteTitle: 'Students Notes 4/4 Hallway Rumors:'
  noteContent: Hey, heard about what's going on? Apparently, something's walking
    around the building. Some kinda "Glitch"? Heard it reacts to flashlight beams,
    but also to loud noises. Gotta be quiet and careful where you shine the light!
